<h2 class='post-title entry-title'>
澎湖縣老人福利促進會大會及健康講座暨歌唱聯誼餐會
</h2>
<span class='post-wrap'>
<p class='post-meta'>
星期二, 6月 09, 2026
<a name='4598999041771083943'></a><i class='fa fa-eye'></i>&#8194;<span id='postviews'></span>Views&#8194;
<span class='post-labels'>
文章分類&#65306;
<a href='https://penghudaily.blogspot.com/search/label/%E6%99%82%E4%BA%8B%E6%96%B0%E8%81%9E' rel='tag'>時事新聞</a>
</span>
